{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter002-004","iteration":2,"label":"BRAT registration requires pluginList plus pluginSubListFrozenVersion; frozen pins are non-empty versions other than latest.","sources":["https://github.com/TfTHacker/obsidian42-brat/blob/main/src/settings.ts","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TfTHacker/obsidian42-brat/main/src/features/BetaPlugins.ts"]}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter002-005","iteration":2,"label":"Activation is separate from staging; BRAT uses Obsidian enable/reload APIs after writing files.","sources":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TfTHacker/obsidian42-brat/main/src/features/BetaPlugins.ts","https://obsidian.md/help/community-plugins","https://docs.obsidian.md/Plugins/Getting%20started/Build%20a%20plugin"]}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter002-006","iteration":2,"label":"Frozen-version headless recipe must fetch the explicit release tag and register that tag in pluginSubListFrozenVersion.","sources":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TfTHacker/obsidian42-brat/main/src/features/BetaPlugins.ts","https://tfthacker.com/brat-plugins"]}
